title: ShopWine
---
// Talk target of the wine shelf in the corner shop (Interact layer). See shop_door.yarn.
-> Look
    <<if visited("PhoneWineChoice") or $r1_thu2_bottle_seen>>
        You: Red Fox, the 2021. That's the one.
        You: Next to it the Reserve. Same fox, gold label. Not that one.
    <<else>>
        You: Three reds. Two of them have a fox on the label.
        You: One of the foxes has a gold label. The third has a price sticker on the front.
    <<endif>>
-> Take the Red Fox 2021 <<if not $item_wine_fox>>
    <<if $item_wine_reserve or $item_wine_house>>
        You: I put the other one back.
    <<endif>>
    <<set $item_wine_reserve to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_house to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_fox to true>>
-> Take the Red Fox Reserve <<if not $item_wine_reserve>>
    <<if $item_wine_fox or $item_wine_house>>
        You: I put the other one back.
    <<endif>>
    <<set $item_wine_fox to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_house to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_reserve to true>>
-> Take the house red <<if not $item_wine_house>>
    <<if $item_wine_fox or $item_wine_reserve>>
        You: I put the other one back.
    <<endif>>
    <<set $item_wine_fox to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_reserve to false>>
    <<set $item_wine_house to true>>
===
